          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4113ee3581c3b45ffef44d30c4fc4aa76f559a6e",
          "message": "Fix and update time semantics for PersistentGraph (#1946)\n\n* fix node_earliest_time\n\n* fix property.get for exploded edges on PersistentGraph\n\n* update and fix the deletion semantics for edges\n\n* update the exploded edge semantics for PersistentGraph and add more tests\n\n* update earliest and latest time semantics for PersistentGraph and add more tests\n\n* update python tests for new semantics\n\n* change the semantics for deletions at the start of the window so they remove all preceding events and are not included in the window\n\n* fix history and add tests\n\n* fix tests\n\n* more tests\n\n* test exploded counts and fix test that was testing old semantics\n\n* add debug for ConstantProperties\n\n* start fixing materialize and add some tests\n\n* constant edge properties should only exist for layers that actually have the edge\n\n* try to clean up proptest\n\n* fix reordering of property values after materialize\n\n* fix proptest range\n\n* tidy up warnings\n\n* tidy\n\n* empty property updates on the graph have no effect and shouldn't change the earliest/latest time\n\n* add proptest for materialize on event graph as well\n\n* fix node updates at same time and add test\n\n* add issue number for the FIXME comments",
          "timestamp": "2025-02-14T16:28:23Z",
