          "distinct": true,
          "id": "44afa696206d1edf3e3656397fc7ccdd3eae84e2",
          "message": "Gql constant time schema (#1954)\n\n* Added level 1 filter§\n\n* Ordered multi filter\n\n* Added functions for edges and nodes\n\n* constant time schema functions for nodes\n\n* Merged master\n\n* spurious extra wrapping with FieldValue breaks the types\n\n* this can be copy if the underlying graph is\n\n* Expose the reset_filter api in GraphQL and add queries for computing the hidden degree of nodes\n\n* add optional argument to retrieve only subset of nodes in GraphQL\n\n* Revert hidden degree\n\n* Revert reset_filter\n\n* add test\n\n* compute variants and actually available properties for small graphs\n\n* tidy up and actually commit dependencies\n\n* fix test for reordered schema output\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ben Steer <bensteer@Bens-MBP.communityfibre.co.uk>\nCo-authored-by: Ben Steer <ben.steer@pometry.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ben Steer <b.a.steer@qmul.ac.uk>",
