          "id": "32a3c3f487963a3e7564d9f478c8e6f72a873bfe",
          "message": "Impl index based filtering for Raphtory APIs alongside Search APIs (#1899)\n\n* move index to graph storage\n\n* fix python, graphql\n\n* fix feature falg\n\n* fix docs\n\n* fmt\n\n* add feature dep\n\n* impl filter collector\n\n* impl custom node filter and node history filter\n\n* add missing node history filter impl\n\n* fix AND node search queries\n\n* ref\n\n* prop indexes\n\n* ref property filter and impl composite filter\n\n* intro propertyfitervalue\n\n* impl nodefilter and node query builder\n\n* impl node filter executor, add tokenizer to properties, fix tests\n\n* ref\n\n* ref composite filter and add search api tests\n\n* introduce composite edge filter and add tests\n\n* simplify query builder\n\n* impl edge query builder, executor, impl tests, ref\n\n* add new to searcher\n\n* edge query executor, searcher ref\n\n* rename query executors to filter executor and similar apis\n\n* impl filter counts and add tests\n\n* ref\n\n* create test mods per api for easier testing/debuging\n\n* add tests\n\n* fix tests and filtering\n\n* update pometry-storage-private\n\n* update pometry-storage-private\n\n* impl basic benchmark code\n\n* fix bench\n\n* fix issue with property indexes creation\n\n* create property indexes earlier\n\n* fix index creation, ref\n\n* improve benches\n\n* add more benches\n\n* more benches\n\n* ref schemas\n\n* fix edge index metadata\n\n* fix the raphtory search bench\n\n* rid unnecessary mutex, fix benches\n\n* add raphtory social graph data generator and graph loader, add more benches\n\n* fix CArgo\n\n* add more benches\n\n* improve accuracy of benches by moving setup to iter_batched setup function\n\n* ref benches\n\n* feed random data into benches from random graph, phew! 🥵\n\n* ref loader\n\n* load graph while generation\n\n* add fn\n\n* impl unique node filter collector\n\n* ref\n\n* impl indexing for windowed graph and persistent graph\n\n* unique filter collector returns unique documents so that it can be used as an intermediate collector, it also utilizes the underlying collector to apply limit and offset\n\n* impl windowed filter for persistent graph\n\n* filter executor updates\n\n* impl fuzzy search for composite filters\n\n* impl fuzzy search for composite filters and search nodes\n\n* impl fuzzy filter for edges\n\n* search nodes tests for windowed graph\n\n* impl node counts search api for windowed graph\n\n* impl search nodes tests for subgraph\n\n* search nodes tests for node type filtered subgraph\n\n* search tests for cached views\n\n* rid count search apis\n\n* added layer_id to edge index docs\n\n* intro edge property filter collector\n\n* fix unique entity filter collector\n\n* edge filter executor now uses unique filter collector, fixes tests\n\n* unique filter collector can return ids directly\n\n* introduce edge property filter collector to executor\n\n* introduce layer_id to prop index docs\n\n* search edge tests for window graph view\n\n* impl search edges tests for node subgraph\n\n* search edges tests for type filtered graph\n\n* add/fix tests\n\n* fix tests\n\n* ref\n\n* init search nodes using latest semantics\n\n* fix merge issues\n\n* fix merge issues and rid dead code\n\n* simplify last_before call\n\n* impl edge history filter\n\n* fix and add tests for edge history filter\n\n* impl latest node filter collector and add tests\n\n* add lnfc\n\n* impl edge history filter collector and add tests\n\n* intro fallback semantic. wip\n\n* intro const/temporal property filters, refactor property indexes initialization\n\n* fix const, temporal index document creation, ref\n\n* impl constant, temporal, property any/latest fallback semantics for nodes\n\n* ref node filter executor and tests\n\n* impl semantics for edge, add tests\n\n* ref\n\n* rename any, not_any property filters to includes and excludes\n\n* intro fluent builder apis. wip\n\n* impl node and edge filter ops\n\n* impl property filter ops\n\n* impl fluent apis and fix all tests\n\n* fixed benches\n\n* intro secondary time indexes\n\n* add secondary indexes to node filter collector\n\n* add secondary time index to edge filter collector\n\n* add secondary time index to latest node filter collector\n\n* add secondary time index to latest edge filter collector\n\n* handle cases when there are multiple node updates at same time involving secondary indexes\n\n* handle cases when there are multiple edge updates at same time involving secondary indexes\n\n* confirms fix #1948\n\n* intro node and edge pyfilters\n\n* into py filter expr\n\n* add more tests, rid special fuzzy search apis\n\n* rid obsolete tests\n\n* impl py property search filters, add tests\n\n* ref tests\n\n* ref\n\n* impl composite py filter\n\n* impl search apis for gql\n\n* add gql test\n\n* update prop to gql translation and fix tests\n\n* fix tests\n\n* fix test\n\n* fix bench build\n\n* more window graph view search api tests\n\n* add more tests for search node api for windowed graph\n\n* add search edge api windowed graph tests\n\n* add more window graph view tests\n\n* add more search edge api window graph tests\n\n* various suggestions on indexing\n\n* add review suggestions\n\n* impl entity index\n\n* fix warnings\n\n* fix update_node_constant_properties: delete existing constant property document\n\n* ref\n\n* fix update_edge_constant_properties to delete existing constant property document\n\n* ref\n\n* impl create_index python\n\n* don't panic on empty value, fix gql create index\n\n* simplify collectors\n\n* upgrade private\n\n* fix limit, offset. simplify collector\n\n* fix is_none test\n\n* fix warnings, allow dead code, ref\n\n* fmt\n\n* fix ci\n\n* fix bench\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Shivam Kapoor <4599890+iamsmkr@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Lucas Jeub <lucas.jeub@pometry.com>\nCo-authored-by: Fabian Murariu <murariu.fabian@gmail.com>",
