          "distinct": true,
          "id": "62436fc5ec23a550cb284b521b569de7072bff29",
          "message": "Decimal support (#1943)\n\n* add support for decimal128\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\tpometry-storage-private\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\tpometry-storage-private\n\n* minor fixes\n\n* add missing file\n\n* add support for Utf8View\n\n* add some more support for utf8view\n\n* fix multiple issues with utf8view\n\n* added validation for bigdecimal so it fits in parquet decimal(38,x)\n\n* parquet decoder has issues\n\n* fixing things\n\n* dependency issues\n\n* fix dependencies and tests\n\n* fix the bigdecimal conversion from Graph to disk Graph\n\n* generate properties other than list and dict\n\n* fix post rebase\n\n* formatting and test\n\n* add big decimal to proto and make unification more strict for Decimal\n\n* rename DecimalTimeCol\n\n* fmt\n\n* fix compilation issues after rebase",
          "timestamp": "2025-03-31T15:13:21+01:00",
