          "id": "87c6d93aea5857cc3696496720c4afe88a017752",
          "message": "Add namespace search to graphql (#1968)\n\n* Initial changes + some missing stubs\n\n* Added more checks, just tests now\n\n* fix escape\n\n* Validation bits - need to sort file existance\n\n* Add working version\n\n* Adding some more tests\n\n* black\n\n* working\n\n* sorting dicts\n\n* remove print\n\n* Fixed PR requests\n\n* fix warnings and test for windows\n\n* moving \\\\ check\n\n* attempt to fix get_relative_path\n\n* fix compilation issue in get_relative_path\n\n* bring pometry-storage-private up to date\n\n* Final changes\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ben Steer <ben.steer@pometry.com>\nCo-authored-by: Lucas Jeub <lucas.jeub@pometry.com>\nCo-authored-by: Fabian Murariu <murariu.fabian@gmail.com>",
