          "id": "48ec588fb37b324bec46813453a0d5c3f1b13fb0",
          "message": "Basic creation/updating of metadata in .raph for MetaGraph (#1976)\n\n* Create and update metadata in .raph when saving/updating graphs\n\n* Handle metadata file being invalid\n\n* Use StaticGraphViewOps instead of GraphViewOps for StableEncode\n\n* fix rebase\n\n* fmt\n\n* fix the write failure test\n\n* Sort output of namespace.graphs endpoint by graph path\n\n* Fix rust format\n\n* swap to ubuntu latest for CI\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Lucas Jeub <lucas.jeub@pometry.com>\nCo-authored-by: Fabian Murariu <murariu.fabian@gmail.com>",
