          "id": "48a104d0dd37c8b25d47237c725640f8d7e492d5",
          "message": "impl index spec (#2103)\n\n* impl index spec\n\n* fallback to raphtory apis for properties for which indexes are not created, add tests\n\n* impl index spec for python\n\n* impl get index spec\n\n* fix loading index spec based index\n\n* move all index tests in one place\n\n* add test\n\n* impl py get_index_spec\n\n* rw indexspec\n\n* check if index needs update\n\n* impl update index\n\n* add test\n\n* more test\n\n* update only existing prop index, don't add any new prop index via update apis\n\n* add tests\n\n* fmt\n\n* fix issues with property indexes, add/fix tests\n\n* ref\n\n* add update index to create_index_in_ram_with_spec, add test\n\n* ref py tests\n\n* impl gql node type filtering for list of node types\n\n* add test\n\n* fix test\n\n* ref\n\n* fix tests\n\n* rid UnknownProperty\n\n* add comment\n\n* rid name and prop type from index spec\n\n* fix indexspec for python\n\n* fix race\n\n* impl suggestions from review\n\n* intro index_ops\n\n* ref, fix warnings\n\n* add test\n\n* fix build\n\n* add test\n\n* fix bench\n\n* ref\n\n* ref\n\n* add props to index_spec\n\n* ref tests\n\n* fix warnings\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Shivam Kapoor <4599890+iamsmkr@users.noreply.github.com>",
