          "message": "Rayon executor for GraphQL (#2128)\n\n* add rayon spawn wrapper and make more things async\n\n* use the new execution wrappers everywhere\n\n* tidy\n\n* add missing await which was breaking the overwrite (but this isn't handled atomically?)\n\n* tidy up some testing commands in the makefile and add missing `await` in tests\n\n* tidy up some graphql tests\n\n* fix the eviction test\n\n* fmt\n\n* tidy\n\n* one more missing await\n\n* try to see if downgrading the action fixes the problem\n\n* more workflow tweaks\n\n* fix the version in the other workflow as well",
