          "id": "9a1d177227a4e5afc15165b8dce90fd3391cd7d3",
          "message": "New docs (#2175)\n\n* new doc generator\n\n* tidy up some bits and make the nav work\n\n* try to make readthedocs work\n\n* some useful make commands\n\n* filter private members from __all__ in stub-gen\n\n* remove old sphinx test from workflow (not needed as this is now running on readthedocs directly)\n\n* tidy\n\n* fix the colour override\n\n* fix 404 page\n\n* add local mkdocs build output\n\n* test env variable for url\n\n* make the module heading link correctly\n\n* use site_url for absolute path to assets\n\n* kinda silly test\n\n* just remove the mascot for now\n\n* Initial user-guide port\n\n* Manually define LHN\n\n* enable heading anchors\n\n* base64 encode mascot\n\n* add data files\n\n* enable codeblocks macro\n\n* working code examples\n\n* inline code examples\n\n* add missing python labels\n\n* swap to bew tabbed blocks syntax\n\n* swap to bew tabbed blocks syntax\n\n* add assetions but hide from user\n\n* convert to new tab syntax\n\n* code blocks run with warnings\n\n* start adding asserts\n\n* add asserts where order is consistent\n\n* add asserts where order is consistent\n\n* add asserts where order is consistent\n\n* remove testing file\n\n* remove flakey tests\n\n* add to make file\n\n* add to github actions\n\n* manually add  extras to requirments\n\n* use manual requirements for python\n\n* path to reqs\n\n* Tidy up navigation\n\n* sync basic branding to new website\n\n* add additional design system colours\n\n* code font\n\n* backup for mono font\n\n* fix dark mode switching and organise css\n\n* restore section headings as pages\n\n* test dummy index page and redirect\n\n* test dummy index page and redirect\n\n* remove meta tag this is better done inside rtd interface\n\n* add dummy index pages\n\n* new index\n\n* new index\n\n* new index\n\n* new index\n\n* snippets as pseudo-components\n\n* clean up home header snippet\n\n* clean up home header snippet\n\n* clean up home header snippet, prefer classes\n\n* Styles for API headings\n\n* be consistent with color variables\n\n* default link colour\n\n* imperative cta\n\n* comment out my prints\n\n* Nicer API headings\n\n* comment out my prints\n\n* initial nav fix\n\n* basic clean up\n\n* use consistent path handling\n\n* populate dummy files\n\n* populate dummy files with correct links\n\n* clearer function names\n\n* rename classes path variables for clarity\n\n* remove unused variable\n\n* use mkdocs object links\n\n* use parts for all initial paths\n\n* remove unused variables\n\n* add a local readme\n\n* consistent userguide names for simpler redirects\n\n* homepage improvements\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Lucas Jeub <lucas.jeub@pometry.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ben Steer <b.a.steer@qmul.ac.uk>",
