          "message": "Graphql docs main (#2196)\n\n* create basic page\n\n* test chained script\n\n* add npx to build environment\n\n* add npx to build environment\n\n* paths from root\n\n* Revert \"paths from root\"\n\nThis reverts commit 3e0e697ddc191b97129af08ad7169b689cd035e5.\n\n* better feedback in log\n\n* flaky test fix\n\n* better feedback in log\n\n* paths relative to docs root\n\n* pathlib for working dir\n\n* better feedback in log\n\n* tmep\n\n* paths from root\n\n* fix summary loading\n\n* remove extra logging\n\n* remove placeholder graphql files\n\n* fix some links\n\n* fix some links\n\n* move script trigger to makefile\n\n* script will create placeholder if does not exist\n\n* full set of make jobs\n\n* add to github actions\n\n* try just creating schema file\n\n* tidy makefile structure\n\n* tidy makefile structure\n\n* use ignored folder for docs server example\n\n* add node steps\n\n* ignore graphql schema test for now\n\n* commit CI fixes to your current branch\n\n* commit CI fixes to your current branch\n\n* add write permissions on content\n\n* commit CI fixes to your current branch\n\n* commit CI fixes to your current branch\n\n* commit CI fixes to your current branch\n\n* pull before git ops\n\n* checkout before git ops\n\n* require github token\n\n* log the branch\n\n* checkout first\n\n* remove file to test CI build\n\n* make all steps linux dependent\n\n* test file creation\n\n* checkout earlier\n\n* check dir with a print\n\n* build trigger\n\n* build trigger\n\n* one checkout\n\n* one checkout\n\n* chore: apply tidy-public auto-fixes\n\n* check failure mode\n\n* move schema creation from tox to github workflow\n\n* crude test attempt\n\n* better test attempt\n\n* log visibility\n\n* correct path\n\n* block linter failures\n\n* chore: apply tidy-public auto-fixes\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
